"""Isolated power/control-to-digital-ABX-module electrical contract.

Pin 6 carries an active-high reset request. The digital board owns the local
open-drain driver for the Pico's active-low RUN input.

The digital module is the source and clock master for the three I2S conductors.
Every conductor is already in the isolated digital domain before it enters the
cable; the digital board therefore needs no control-link isolation components.
"""

DigitalAbxLink = interface(
    V5_ISO=Power(),
    DIGITAL_GND=Ground(),
    SDA=Net(),
    SCL=Net(),
    DSP_RESET_REQUEST=Net(),
    DSP_STATUS=Net(),
    DSP_I2S_BCK=Net(),
    DSP_I2S_LRCK=Net(),
    DSP_I2S_DOUT=Net(),
)
